            <ArticleTitle>Back pain intensity underestimated.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>59</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A quality assurance program conducted by German physicians and physiotherapists about back pain is described. The results of the program documented that this common disorder was underestimated in over half of the cases.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
